---

cswitch mirrors the command-line interface, dashboard and on-disk conventions of
claude-swap (https://github.com/realiti4/claude-swap, MIT, Onur Cetinkol) and
ports the Codex credential, usage and app-server mechanics of codex-switch
(https://github.com/xjoker/codex-switch, MIT). Both are used under their MIT
licenses; their copyright notices are reproduced in NOTICE.
